OL,3,GNEWSAHit-and-run driver who killed
OL,4,Apedestrian jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who struck a pedestrian then
OL,7,Fcalled his partner "screaming" that he
OL,8,Fhad "hit or killed somebody" has been
OL,9,Fjailed.
OL,11,FSam Pope died after being hit by Marcin
OL,12,FPilarski's car while walking along
OL,13,FOilmills Road in Ramsey Mereside,
OL,14,FCambridgeshire, just before 23:00 BST
OL,15,Fon 11 May 2024.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
