OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHit-and-run driver who killed
OL,4,Apedestrian jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridgeshire Police said Pilarski
OL,7,Fleft the scene, but officers were
OL,8,Fcalled soon after by his partner, who
OL,9,Ftold them he had returned home in her
OL,10,FVauxhall Astra with a smashed
OL,11,Fwindscreen and headlamp, and blood on
OL,12,Fthe front.
OL,14,FPilarski, 36, of Sorrell Avenue,
OL,15,FWhittlesey, was jailed for one year and
OL,16,Fthree months by Cambridge Crown Court,
OL,17,Fafter admitting causing death by
OL,18,Fdriving a car without a licence or
OL,19,Finsurance.
